<title>PORTUGAL: Avg yield 5.4063 pct on Portuguese 3-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Avg yield 5.4063 pct on Portuguese 3-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Treasury's auction of 28.5 billion escudos of three-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY:  23 Mar 2000</p>
<p>    COUPON: 5.375 pct	 AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.4063</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.42</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY:  ANNUAL</p>
<p>NOTES: This is the first issue of the March 2000 series.</p>
</text>
